614833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xesvx","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T18:24:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T18:24:20Z","body":"Hardware:\n```\ncpe:/o:nixos:nixos:25.11 #1-NixOS SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed Jun  4 12:46:27 UTC 2025 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RAPHAEL_MENDOCINO) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 30.48 GiB memory\n```\n\nCan reproduce on `Godot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.46c495ca21` (I expect being just before the 44% step is just the UI not having updated yet)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa486b7b-95e1-4eea-9141-00efac96343e)\nThe editor freezes completely,  not even pressing close is responds I had to ctrl + c out of it.\n\nOn `Godot Engine v4.4.1.stable.custom_build.49a5bc7b6` the issue is much worse, after optimising structures the editor still freezes but first vulkan crashes and then godot crashes from an illegal instruction.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aad871c3-89af-4ccb-bd30-495ff4faf89f)\n[bug.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20760078/bug.log)\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977614833/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979650347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106839#issuecomment-2979650347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106839","id":2979650347,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xmdsr","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T09:33:41Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T09:33:41Z","body":"Narrowed down the causes of freezing.\nThere are several times where we sort triangles and never finish\n\nCulprit lines\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/modules/lightmapper_rd/lightmapper_rd.cpp#L517\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/modules/lightmapper_rd/lightmapper_rd.cpp#L536\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/modules/lightmapper_rd/lightmapper_rd.cpp#L592\n\nWrapping all of these calls with `print_line(\"sort start\")` and `print_line(\"sort_end\")` will show that the sorting never finishes.\nThe third call in particular actually crashes outright from index out of range but assuming that's because I commented out the previous sorts, I would expect that fixing the index out of range would also trigger an infinite sort.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979650347/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979721626","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106839#issuecomment-2979721626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106839","id":2979721626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xmvGa","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T09:56:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T09:56:12Z","body":"Hard to imagine it's a problem with the sort algorithm being broken since apparently there are `2230509` triangles and `4758968` \"triangle sort\"s in the tps demo.\n\nThis will reproduce that sorting absolutely huge lists just sort of takes forever (run with `godot --script script.gd`)\n```gd\nextends SceneTree\n\nfunc _initialize():\n\tvar nums: Array[int] = []\n\tnums.resize(2000000)\n\tfor i in range(2000000):\n\t\tvar el: int = randi_range(0, 10000)\n\t\tnums.push_back(el)\n\t\n\tprint(\"begin sort\")\n\tnums.sort()\n\tprint(\"end sort\")\n\n```\n\nIt seems that the only thing to do here is change the algorithm so that we don't sort lists with 2 million items.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979721626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980183300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106839#issuecomment-2980183300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106839","id":2980183300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xof0E","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url"